    [CI] adapts the Nightly framework to support PP-size (#17984)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    This PR mainly adapts the Nightly framework to support PP parallelism.
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    no
    ### How was this patch tested?
    run the cases
